node_modules/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.mypy_cache/
.DS_Store
uploads_result.json
# Derived from the play's script on every deployment, never a piece of data. This
# line carries weight: uploads.yml commits the whole of `plays`, so without it a
# 150 kB binary would enter the history on every script upload.
plays/*/data/script.pdf
# The temporary file of the dev download (`ensureScriptPdf` in vite.config.js
# writes `.part` then renames, so a concurrent request cannot land on a
# half-written PDF). It only survives an interrupted write (full disk, server
# killed between the two calls), and that is precisely where it must not show up
# in the `git status` of a folder the Action commits whole.
plays/*/data/script.pdf.part
# A play's pages are GENERATED from the templates in `pages/` (one per play and
# per page), in dev as at build time: cf. vite.config.js. They are derived like
# the PDF, and for the same reason they do not enter the history, which every new
# play would otherwise fill with seven files identical to its neighbour's.
plays/*/*.html
